029
# The highest migration version reviewed under the expand/migrate/contract rule.
#
# Everything ABOVE this number has to pass `npm run migrate:check`. Everything at or below it
# shipped before the gate existed and cannot be made compatible retroactively — a gate that fails
# on history is a gate somebody disables.
#
# Raise this only when the migrations between the old value and the new one have actually been
# reviewed against the rule. It is one number in its own file precisely so that raising it is
# visible in a diff rather than buried in a config change.
